#: docs/zh/tutorials/examples.md:19
msgid ""
"示例通过 `xgl::xgl` 和公开 SDK 头使用协议，应用负责时间和存储。公共同步主机 PHY 把帧复制到有界字节队列。`boot_update` 在应用内编码块位置并校验镜像 "
"CRC，从公开诊断头读取重传计数。"
msgstr ""
"The examples use `xgl::xgl` and the public SDK headers. The application supplies time and storage. A "
"shared synchronous host PHY copies frames into bounded byte queues. `boot_update` encodes block "
"positions and checks the image CRC inside the application. It reads retransmission counts through the "
"public diagnostics header."

#: docs/zh/tutorials/examples.md:21
msgid "运行"
msgstr "Run"

#: docs/zh/tutorials/examples.md:23
msgid ""
"显式开启 `XGL_BUILD_EXAMPLES=ON`。运行 CTest 示例还需开启 `XGL_BUILD_TESTS` 或 `XGL_BUILD_NOHEAP_SMOKE`。Boot "
"不构建转发示例。按[首次收发](first-link.md)运行 echo，其他可执行文件和边界见 `examples/*/README.md`。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `XGL_BUILD_EXAMPLES=ON`. Set `XGL_BUILD_TESTS` or `XGL_BUILD_NOHEAP_SMOKE` to register the "
"examples with CTest. Boot excludes the forwarding example. [Run your first link](first-link.md) gives "
"the echo commands. See `examples/*/README.md` for the other executables and their limits."
